Package: libtracker-sparql-3.0-0
Version: @DEB_TRACKER_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/tracker
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libsqlite3-0, libjson-glib-1.0-0, dbus
Description: Tracker SPARQL store library - runtime
 libtracker-sparql is the client/store library for the Tracker RDF/SQLite
 database, linked by nautilus for search. The indexer daemon (localsearch) is a
 separate, optional package; without it, search returns no indexed results.
